Modifications to MMSegmentation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DADNet is a fork of MMSegmentation 1.2.2.  The following files are new or have
been modified relative to the upstream release:

  Modified:
    mmseg/datasets/basesegdataset.py
        - BaseSegDataset.load_data_list() now reads a JSON-Lines split file
          whose entries may be relative to data_root.

  Added:
    mmseg/models/backbones/unet_improve.py     DADNet backbone (DFWE + MDCF)
    mmseg/models/utils/wavelet.py              wavelet transform helpers
    mmseg/models/utils/plug.py                 attention blocks
    mmseg/datasets/SD900Dataset.py             NEU-Seg dataset
    configs/dadnet/                            DADNet configs
    tools/prepare_dataset.py                   dataset preparation

  Removed (upstream modules unrelated to DADNet):
    several backbone / decode-head modules that were specific to other
    projects, together with their registry entries in the corresponding
    __init__.py files.

Code that remains unmodified from MMSegmentation retains its original
"Copyright (c) OpenMMLab. All rights reserved." headers.
